        <p>LONDON AND NO'CrEl-WESTERN RAILWAY, GAIISTON DOICS AND WIDNES DOCKS. The Londnu and North- sVester Railway Company. GIVE NOTICE that MONDAY JUNE 4th, being a HOLIDAY under the Holiday Extel,sion Act, 1875, the day Will be. ebserved as a holiday at GARSTON IMOKi and WIDNES DOCKS and the Quay nd. agate. FRED HARRISON, General Manager.</p>
