hich result Item it. sth. By removing impurities, strengthening, the wean parzs of the system, and purifying the blood, the human frame is well fortified to withstand the attacks of disease. It is repelled, and its place taken by health and strength, through the effec'ive action of G wilym Evans' Quinine Bitters. The Vegetable Tonic. Sold everywhere in betties, 2s. 9d. and 4s. 61. each, or will be sent carriage free for these prices, direct fr,m the Sole Proprietors :—Quinice Bittets Manufacrurine Company. Limited, Llanelly, South Wales. Beware of imitations. See that you eet the genuine P:eparation with the rame " Gwi4m Evans "on Label, Stamp, and Bottle without which Ilene is genuine.</p>
