        <p>VALUABLE DISCOVERY FOR THE HAIR,—If your hair is turning grey orwhite or falling off uae the MEXICAN HAIR RENEWER, for it will positively restore, in every ease, grey or white hair to its original colour. It makes the hair charmingly beautiful, as well as promoting the growth. Price 35 6d per bottle.—Adot•</p>
        <p>FLOR/LINE I—FOR THE TEMIZ AND BEELTH.—Thorowhly cleanses the teeth from all parasites or impurities, harden the gums, previ.., ts tartar, stops decay. and gives to the teet% a peculiar pearly whiteness and a delightful fragrance to the breath. Price 2s. 6d. for the liquid, or Is. per jar for the Floriline "Powder." of all Chemists and Perfumers.— Arlo</p>
        <p>CLARKE'S B 41 PILLS are warranted to cure. In eith sex, all acquired or constitutional Discharges from the Urinary Organs, Gravel and Paine in the back. Brea from Mercury Established upwards of 30 years. In boxes 45. 64 ach, of all Chemists and Patent Medicine Vendors t h ough nt the world, or sent for sixty stamps by the makers The incoln and Midland Counties Drag Company, Lincoln.</p>
        <p>For the past quarter of a century there has been continuous flow of letters bearing testimony to the truly wonderful cures effected by CLARKE'S WORLD-FAMED BLOOD MIXTURE, "the finest Blood Purifier that science and medical skill have brought to light." Sufferers from Scrofula, Scurvy, Eczema, Bad Legs, Skin and Blood Disease, Pimples, and Sores of any kind, are solicited to give it a trial to test its value. Sold everywhere. at 23. 9d. 'per bottle bware of worthlesimitations and substitutes. —Advt (6)</p>
